  "cells": [
    {
      "id": "2e134cf2",
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "# 神经网络导出为ONNX格式"
      ],
      "attachments": {},
      "metadata": {
        "name": "章节名称",
        "engee": {
          "isDisplay": true,
          "isParagraph": true,
          "isClosedParagraph": false,
          "amountHideCellsInside": 0,
          "codeOutputView": "col",
          "codeOutputHidden": false
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "07abfa47",
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "创建神经网络并将其保存为ONNX格式以供后续使用。"
      ],
      "attachments": {},
      "metadata": {
        "name": "章节名称",
        "engee": {
          "isDisplay": true,
          "isParagraph": false,
          "isClosedParagraph": false,
          "amountHideCellsInside": 0,
          "codeOutputView": "col",
          "codeOutputHidden": false
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "14721e60",
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "## 任务描述"
      ],
      "attachments": {},
      "metadata": {
        "name": "章节名称",
        "engee": {
          "isDisplay": true,
          "isParagraph": true,
          "isClosedParagraph": false,
          "amountHideCellsInside": 0,
          "codeOutputView": "col",
          "codeOutputHidden": false
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "8556b64a",
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "为了将训练好的神经网络部署到目标环境甚至嵌入到微控制器的代码中，常见的解决方案是将神经网络转换为标准且与框架无关的ONNX格式（Open Neural Network eXchange）。\n\nJulia中最流行的神经网络创建和训练库是`Flux`。它支持创建全连接、卷积、递归神经网络及其他拓扑结构的图，可以编写自定义的神经元和层模型，而训练和前向计算以编译后的二进制形式执行，速度不逊于C语言。\n\n将Flux神经网络导出为ONNX的功能在多个库中都有提供，但目前最成功的导出工具是`NaiveNAXflux`库中的导出模块。该库包含将Flux库与神经网络最优拓扑搜索库（*NAS - Neural Architecture Search*）关联的工具。NaiveNAS负责处理权重和神经网络拓扑结构的修改，而其配套的包（如NaiveGAflux）则管理遗传优化。\n\n我们还将安装`ONNXRunTime`库，它允许我们运行和测试保存的神经网络。"
      ],
      "attachments": {},
      "metadata": {
        "name": "章节名称",
        "engee": {
          "isDisplay": true,
          "isParagraph": false,
          "isClosedParagraph": false,
          "amountHideCellsInside": 0,
          "codeOutputView": "col",
          "codeOutputHidden": false
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "517cd8a5",
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "## 保存神经网络为ONNX"
      ],
      "attachments": {},
      "metadata": {
        "name": "章节名称",
        "engee": {
          "isDisplay": true,
          "isParagraph": true,
          "isClosedParagraph": false,
          "amountHideCellsInside": 0,
          "codeOutputView": "col",
          "codeOutputHidden": false
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "30fcc1a3",
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "安装所需的库："
      ],
      "attachments": {},
      "metadata": {
        "name": "章节名称",
        "engee": {
          "isDisplay": true,
          "isParagraph": false,
          "isClosedParagraph": false,
          "amountHideCellsInside": 0,
          "codeOutputView": "col",
          "codeOutputHidden": false
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "e45976ab",
      "cell_type": "code",
      "source": [
        "Pkg.add([\"Flux\", \"ONNXNaiveNASflux\", \"ONNXRunTime\", \"ONNXLowLevel\"])"
      ],
      "execution_count": 0,
      "outputs": [
        {
          "output_type": "stream",
          "name": "stderr",
          "text": "\u001b[32m\u001b[1m   Resolving\u001b[22m\u001b[39m package versions...\n\u001b[36m\u001b[1m     Project\u001b[22m\u001b[39m No packages added to or removed from `~/.project/Project.toml`\n\u001b[36m\u001b[1m    Manifest\u001b[22m\u001b[39m No packages added to or removed from `~/.project/Manifest.toml`\n"
        }
      ],
      "metadata": {
        "name": "章节名称",
        "engee": {
          "isDisplay": true,
          "isParagraph": false,
          "isClosedParagraph": false,
          "amountHideCellsInside": 0,
          "codeOutputView": "col",
          "codeOutputHidden": false,
          "outputInfo": {
            "isExpanded": false,
            "scrollTop": 0
          },
          "maskInfo": {
            "isMaskVisible": true,
            "isEditorVisible": true,
            "isAutoplayActive": false
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "a6c84bfd",
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "导入这些库后，我们就可以将简单的全连接网络导出为ONNX格式："
      ],
      "attachments": {},
      "metadata": {
        "name": "章节名称",
        "engee": {
          "isDisplay": true,
          "isParagraph": false,
          "isClosedParagraph": false,
          "amountHideCellsInside": 0,
          "codeOutputView": "col",
          "codeOutputHidden": false
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "5ae35393",
      "cell_type": "code",
      "source": [
        "using Flux\nusing ONNXNaiveNASflux"
      ],
      "execution_count": 0,
      "outputs": [],
      "metadata": {
        "name": " ",
        "engee": {
          "isDisplay": true,
          "isParagraph": false,
          "isClosedParagraph": false,
          "amountHideCellsInside": 0,
          "codeOutputView": "col",
          "codeOutputHidden": false,
          "outputInfo": {
            "isExpanded": false,
            "scrollTop": 0
          },
          "maskInfo": {
            "isMaskVisible": true,
            "isEditorVisible": true,
            "isAutoplayActive": false
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "6e00692f",
      "cell_type": "code",
      "source": [
        "# 定义模型\nmodel = Chain(\n    Dense(784 => 32, relu),\n    Dense(32 => 10)\n)\n\n# 使用save()导出为ONNX\nONNXNaiveNASflux.save(\"fc_model.onnx\", model, (784, 1));"
      ],
      "execution_count": 0,
      "outputs": [],
      "metadata": {
        "name": "章节名称",
        "engee": {
          "isDisplay": true,
          "isParagraph": false,
          "isClosedParagraph": false,
          "amountHideCellsInside": 0,
          "codeOutputView": "col",
          "codeOutputHidden": false,
          "outputInfo": {
            "isExpanded": false,
            "scrollTop": 0
          },
          "maskInfo": {
            "isMaskVisible": true,
            "isEditorVisible": true,
            "isAutoplayActive": false
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "41a23db9",
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "该命令的最后一个参数指定输入数据的维度，格式为*特征数量*、*批次大小* (*features, batch\\_size*)。\n\n对象描述中的特征数量可以从Flux神经网络的属性中获取，但批次大小在Flux中并未固定。"
      ],
      "attachments": {},
      "metadata": {
        "name": "章节名称",
        "engee": {
          "isDisplay": true,
          "isParagraph": false,
          "isClosedParagraph": false,
          "amountHideCellsInside": 0,
          "codeOutputView": "col",
          "codeOutputHidden": false
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "c47f3068",
      "cell_type": "code",
      "source": [
        "first_layer = model[1]\ninput_size = size(first_layer.weight, 2)"
      ],
      "execution_count": 0,
      "outputs": [
        {
          "output_type": "execute_result",
          "data": {
            "text/plain": "784"
          },
          "metadata": {},
          "execution_count": 49
        }
      ],
      "metadata": {
        "name": "章节名称",
        "engee": {
          "isDisplay": true,
          "isParagraph": false,
          "isClosedParagraph": false,
          "amountHideCellsInside": 0,
          "codeOutputView": "col",
          "codeOutputHidden": false,
          "outputInfo": {
            "isExpanded": false,
            "scrollTop": 0
          },
          "maskInfo": {
            "isMaskVisible": true,
            "isEditorVisible": true,
            "isAutoplayActive": false
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "182169b6",
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "## 运行之前保存的神经网络"
      ],
      "attachments": {},
      "metadata": {
        "name": "章节名称",
        "engee": {
          "isDisplay": true,
          "isParagraph": true,
          "isClosedParagraph": false,
          "amountHideCellsInside": 0,
          "codeOutputView": "col",
          "codeOutputHidden": false
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "ac59904c",
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "运行保存的神经网络（网络中的权重由随机数初始化，因此输出将是噪声）："
      ],
      "attachments": {},
      "metadata": {
        "name": "章节名称",
        "engee": {
          "isDisplay": true,
          "isParagraph": false,
          "isClosedParagraph": false,
          "amountHideCellsInside": 0,
          "codeOutputView": "col",
          "codeOutputHidden": false
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "5fa3803c",
      "cell_type": "code",
      "source": [
        "import ONNXRunTime as ORT\nfc_model = ORT.load_inference(\"fc_model.onnx\")\nfc_model"
      ],
      "execution_count": 0,
      "outputs": [
        {
          "output_type": "execute_result",
          "data": {
            "text/plain": "InferenceSession\n    input_names:        [\"data_0\"]\n    output_names:       [\"dense_1\"]\n    execution_provider: :cpu\n"
          },
          "metadata": {},
          "execution_count": 50
        }
      ],
      "metadata": {
        "name": "章节名称",
        "engee": {
          "isDisplay": true,
          "isParagraph": false,
          "isClosedParagraph": false,
          "amountHideCellsInside": 0,
          "codeOutputView": "col",
          "codeOutputHidden": false,
          "outputInfo": {
            "isExpanded": false,
            "scrollTop": 0
          },
          "maskInfo": {
            "isMaskVisible": true,
            "isEditorVisible": true,
            "isAutoplayActive": false
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "f3ea93fd",
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "现在使用权重名称来设置输入并从保存的ONNX神经网络中获取输出："
      ],
      "attachments": {},
      "metadata": {
        "name": "章节名称",
        "engee": {
          "isDisplay": true,
          "isParagraph": false,
          "isClosedParagraph": false,
          "amountHideCellsInside": 0,
          "codeOutputView": "col",
          "codeOutputHidden": false
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "ff1d95f0",
      "cell_type": "code",
      "source": [
        "result = []\n\nfor x in eachcol(rand(Float32, 784, 20))\n    input_data = Dict(\"data_0\" => reshape(x, 1, :))\n    outputs = fc_model(input_data)\n    append!(result, [outputs[\"dense_1\"]])\nend\n\ngr()\ndefault(fontfamily=\"/user/NotoSansSC-Regular\")\nplot(vcat(result...), title=\"神经网络对随机对象的预测\")"
      ],
      "execution_count": 0,
      "outputs": [
        {
          "output_type": "execute_result",
          "data": {
            "image/png": "",
            "text/html": "<img src=\"data:image/png;base64,\" />",
