    {
      "id": "3ae95f0b",
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "## 卷积网络"
      ],
      "attachments": {},
      "metadata": {
        "name": "章节名称",
        "engee": {
          "isDisplay": true,
          "isParagraph": true,
          "isClosedParagraph": false,
          "amountHideCellsInside": 0,
          "codeOutputView": "col",
          "codeOutputHidden": false
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "4de44bc1",
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "只要遵循参数顺序，对卷积神经网络执行相同的操作并不复杂："
      ],
      "attachments": {},
      "metadata": {
        "name": "章节名称",
        "engee": {
          "isDisplay": true,
          "isParagraph": false,
          "isClosedParagraph": false,
          "amountHideCellsInside": 0,
          "codeOutputView": "col",
          "codeOutputHidden": false
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "7cda5399",
      "cell_type": "code",
      "source": [
        "using Flux\nusing ONNXNaiveNASflux\n\n# 简单卷积网络\n# 输入：28x28（1通道），输出：10个类别（例如数字0-9）\ncnn_model = Chain(\n    Conv((3, 3), 1 => 4, relu), # 卷积：3x3滤波器，1个输入通道，4个输出通道\n    Flux.flatten,               # 将张量展平为向量\n    Dense(26 * 26 * 4 => 10)    # 全连接分类层\n)\n\n# 以Flux/Julia格式设置维度：(Width=28, Height=28, Channels=1, Batch=1)\ninput_shape_cnn = (28, 28, 1, 1)\n\n# 导出\nONNXNaiveNASflux.save(\"cnn_model.onnx\", cnn_model, input_shape_cnn);"
      ],
      "execution_count": 0,
      "outputs": [],
      "metadata": {
        "name": "章节名称",
        "engee": {
          "isDisplay": true,
          "isParagraph": false,
          "isClosedParagraph": false,
          "amountHideCellsInside": 0,
          "codeOutputView": "col",
          "codeOutputHidden": false,
          "outputInfo": {
            "isExpanded": false,
            "scrollTop": 0
          },
          "maskInfo": {
            "isMaskVisible": true,
            "isEditorVisible": true,
            "isAutoplayActive": false
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "8ea3ff95",
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "然后运行保存为ONNX的卷积神经网络："
      ],
      "attachments": {},
      "metadata": {
        "name": "章节名称",
        "engee": {
          "isDisplay": true,
          "isParagraph": false,
          "isClosedParagraph": false,
          "amountHideCellsInside": 0,
          "codeOutputView": "col",
          "codeOutputHidden": false
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "b19416c4",
      "cell_type": "code",
      "source": [
        "import ONNXRunTime as ORT\n\n# 加载模型\nonnx_cnn_model = ORT.load_inference(\"cnn_model.onnx\")\n\n# 1. 生成Julia格式的随机28x28单通道\"图像\" (W, H, C)\n# 在实际任务中，这里将是真实图像\nraw_image = rand(Float32, 28, 28, 1) \n\n# 2. 为ONNX重新排列轴\n# 从 (W=28, H=28, C=1) 变为 (C=1, H=28, W=28)\npermuted_image = permutedims(raw_image, (3, 2, 1))\n\n# 在第一个位置添加批次维度 -> 得到 (Batch=1, C=1, H=28, W=28)\ninput_tensor = reshape(permuted_image, 1, 1, 28, 28)\n\n# 3. 传入模型（第一层的输入名称通常为\"data_0\"）\ninput_data = Dict(\"data_0\" => input_tensor)\noutputs = onnx_cnn_model(input_data)\n\n# 4. 提取输出数据\n# 输出将是10个类别的logits（概率）张量\nonnx_output = outputs[\"dense_0\"]\n\n# 5. 强制转换为用于绘图的一维向量（10个元素）\n# 这可以保护我们免受输出中任何批次结构的影响（无论是1x10还是10x1）\nplot_data = reshape(onnx_output, :)\n\n# 可视化10个类别的预测结果\ngr()\nbar(plot_data, title=\"CNN对随机图像的预测\", \n    xticks=1:10, xlabel=\"类别 (0-9)\", ylabel=\"网络置信度\", legend=false)"
      ],
      "execution_count": 0,
      "outputs": [
        {
          "output_type": "execute_result",
          "data": {
